<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span style="font-size: medium;">Ap&oacute;s o sucesso da primeira edi&ccedil;&atilde;o do evento esportivo do <strong>SEST SENAT em Alagoinhas</strong>, o projeto ganha uma nova identidade, novos desafios e ainda mais protagonismo no cen&aacute;rio esportivo da cidade.</span></p>
<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span style="font-size: medium;">Esse ano o&nbsp;<strong>Circuito de Corridas SEST SENAT - 21K Alagoinhas</strong>, reunir&aacute;&nbsp;<strong>caminhada de 3 km, corridas de 7 km e 21 km</strong>, com um grande marco para o esporte local: a realiza&ccedil;&atilde;o da <strong>1&ordf; Meia Maratona de Alagoinhas</strong>.</span></p>
<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span style="font-size: medium;">Realizado pelo <strong>SEST SENAT &ndash; Unidade Alagoinhas</strong>, o circuito amplia a proposta iniciada na edi&ccedil;&atilde;o anterior, incentivando a pr&aacute;tica esportiva, a sa&uacute;de e a qualidade de vida, al&eacute;m de valorizar os trabalhadores do transporte e integrar toda a comunidade.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: medium;">Uma nova etapa come&ccedil;a. <strong>Mais desafios, mais quil&ocirc;metros e uma nova hist&oacute;ria para a corrida de rua em Alagoinhas.</strong></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: large;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 204, 0);"><b><span style="line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">DADOS DO EVENTO</span></b></span></span><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">Local:</span></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;"> Estacionamento do Est&aacute;dio Carneir&atilde;o &ndash; Alagoinhas/BA<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">Data:</span></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;"> 18 de outubro de 2026<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><b>Modalidades: </b></span></font></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 16px;">Corrida Oficial - 7km e 21km</span></font></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 16px;">Caminhada - 3km</span></font></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">Hor&aacute;rio de Largada: </span></b></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">Corrida (21km) - </span><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">&agrave;s 5h</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">Corrida 7km - </span><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">&agrave;s 6h</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">Caminhada 3km - </span><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">&agrave;s 6h</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: large;"><span style="background-color: rgb(0, 255, 0);"><strong style="font-size: medium;"><span style="line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">IMPORTANTE:</span></strong></span></span><span style="font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;A corrida ter&aacute; dura&ccedil;&atilde;o m&aacute;xima de tr&ecirc;s horas (5h &agrave;s 8h) para a dist&acirc;ncia de 21k e duas horas (6h &agrave;s 8h) para as dist&acirc;ncias de 7k e 3k.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:&#10;justify;line-height:normal"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">Para a prova de 21k</span></strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;"> haver&aacute; um <b>Ponto de Corte no km 14</b> </span></span><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">(Rua 24 de Maio esquina com Conselheiro Saraiva) &ndash; Tempo: 1h45 &ndash; Pace 7:30min/km &ndash; m&iacute;nimo para n&atilde;o ser desclassificado.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:&#10;justify;line-height:normal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:&#10;justify;line-height:normal"><img src="/eficiente/repositorio/224.jpeg" width="300" height="400" vspace="0" hspace="0" border="0" alt="" /></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:&#10;justify;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: large;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 204, 0);"><b><span style="line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">INSCRI&Ccedil;&Otilde;ES</span></b></span></span><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="background-color: rgb(204, 153, 255);"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">Associados SEST/SENAT</span></strong></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;"> - Trabalhador do transporte com cadastro ativo na institui&ccedil;&atilde;o.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;"><b>&nbsp; &nbsp;- INSCRI&Ccedil;&Atilde;O GRATUITA + 4kg de alimentos </b>(2kg de arroz + 2kg de feij&atilde;o)</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;"><b>Solicitar cupom para inscri&ccedil;&atilde;o no SEST/SENAT - Unidade Alagoinhas</b></span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="background-color: rgb(204, 153, 255);"><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">P&uacute;blico Geral:&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: large;"><b><span style="line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">Lote de lan&ccedil;amento:&nbsp;</span>R$ 60,00</b></span><font size="3"><b> <span style="font-size: large;">+ 2kg de alimentos</span> </b>(1kg de arroz + 1kg de feij&atilde;o)</font></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">Use o Cupom: <span style="font-size: large;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">SEST/SENAT</span></span> </span></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">(e garanta 20% de desconto)</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: medium;"><span style="background-color: rgb(0, 255, 0);"><strong><span style="line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">IMPORTANTE:</span></strong></span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;"> </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">- Todos os participantes de P&uacute;blico Geral: doa&ccedil;&atilde;o obrigat&oacute;ria de 2kg de alimentos (1kg de arroz + 1kg de feij&atilde;o) no ato da retirada do kit.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">-&nbsp;<span style="font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 16px;">Todos os participantes Trabalhadores do Transporte: doa&ccedil;&atilde;o obrigat&oacute;ria de 4kg de alimentos (2kg de arroz + 2kg de feij&atilde;o) no ato da retirada do kit.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: large;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 204, 0);"><b><span style="line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">PREMIA&Ccedil;&Atilde;O</span></b></span></span><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">&nbsp;</span></b></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: medium;"><strong><span style="background-color: rgb(204, 153, 255);"><span style="line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">&nbsp;Corrida 21km&nbsp;</span></span></strong></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">1&ordm; ao 5&ordm; lugar GERAL (feminino e masculino)&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><strong style="font-size: medium;"><span style="background-color: rgb(204, 153, 255);"><span style="line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">&nbsp;Corrida 7km</span></span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 16px;">1&ordm; ao 5&ordm; lugar GERAL (feminino e masculino)</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">1&ordm; ao 5&ordm; lugar PCD (feminino e masculino)</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">1&ordm; ao 5&ordm; lugar 60+ (feminino e masculino)</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><strong style="font-size: medium;"><span style="background-color: rgb(204, 153, 255);"><span style="line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">&nbsp;Caminhada 3km</span></span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 16px;">Paticipa&ccedil;&atilde;o recreativa sem competi&ccedil;&atilde;o, sem p&oacute;dio e sem premi&ccedil;&atilde;o. </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="background-color: rgb(0, 255, 0);"><span style="font-size: medium;"><strong><span style="line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">IMPORTANTE</span></strong></span><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">:</span></strong></span><span style="font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp;Todos os participantes da corrida e caminhada receber&atilde;o medalha de partcipa&ccedil;&atilde;o.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-size: medium;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 204, 0);"><b style="font-size: large;"><span style="font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">IDOSOS E PCD:</span></b></span></span><b style="font-size: large;"><span style="font-family: Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;">&nbsp;</span></b></p>
<p><span style="font-size: medium;">As inscri&ccedil;&otilde;es para IDOSOS e PCD tem 50% de desconto.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: medium;">- IDOSOS - desconto aplicado automaticamente no ato da inscri&ccedil;&atilde;o.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: medium;">- PCD - necess&aacute;rio enviar email para: <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);"><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="d8b1b6abbbaab1bbb7bdab98b9ababbdababb7aab9aaa8aab7bcadbbb7bdabf6bbb7b5f6baaa">[email&#160;protected]</a></span> anexando documento oficial com foto e documento que comprove a condi&ccedil;&atilde;o, para receber o cupom para inscri&ccedil;&atilde;o.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-size: medium;">Regulamento oficial da prova <span style="background-color: rgb(0, 255, 0);"><strong><u><a href="http://assessorarproducoes.com.br/eficiente/repositorio/225.pdf" target="_blank">CLIQUE AQUI</a></u></strong></span></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: medium;">Autoriza&ccedil;&atilde;o para participa&ccedil;&atilde;o de menor de idade </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 153, 102);"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);"><strong><span style="font-size: large;"><a href="http://assessorarproducoes.com.br/eficiente/repositorio/212.pdf" target="_blank"><span style="background-color: rgb(0, 255, 0);"><u><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: medium;">CLIQUE AQUI!</span></span></u></span></a></span></strong></span></span></p>
