<p><span style="font-size: large;"><strong>1&ordm; Lote:&nbsp;</strong></span><strong><span style="font-size: large;">R$99,90</span></strong><span style="font-size: large;">&nbsp;(valor com desconto de 1&ordm; lote)&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: large;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);"><strong style="font-size: large;">ENCERRADO!</strong></span></span></p>
